"The <strong>total tax amount</strong> has been <strong>forced</strong> to "
"%(forced_amount)s (amount computed by Odoo was: %(initial_amount)s)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Загальну суму податку</strong> було <strong>примусово</strong> "
"встановлено на %(forced_amount)s (сума, обчислена Odoo: %(initial_amount)s)."

#. module: account_invoice_import
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_invoice_import/wizard/account_invoice_import.py:0
